+"""Local API configuration, with secrets kept outside exportable settings.
+
+Windows credentials use current-user DPAPI. On other platforms the fallback is
+a local file restricted to mode 0600; it is deliberately not called encryption.
+This module never contacts providers and never claims that credentials work.
