" lang="ms">Sediakan draf pembekal</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Prepara borradores</span></span></h3><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Download simulated drafts, or connect your own Gmail and review a draft before saving. This app does not send email.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">下载模拟草稿，或连接自己的 Gmail，核对后保存草稿。此应用不发送邮件。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Muat turun draf simulasi atau sambungkan Gmail anda dan semak sebelum menyimpan. Aplikasi ini tidak menghantar e-mel.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Descarga borradores simulados o conecta tu Gmail y revisa antes de guardar. La aplicación no envía correos.</span></span></p></article></div></section>
+<section class="data-section"><div class="wrap section"><h2 id="connections"><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Your accounts. Your choice.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">你的账号，由你决定。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Akaun anda. Pilihan anda.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Tus cuentas. Tu decisión.</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Each visitor has a simulated café in this browser profile. Optional Gmail connects your own Google account to save an approved demo draft. Optional Runpod uses your own endpoint and key for one explicitly approved paid review. No owner keys are shared. The local installed workbench remains separate.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">每位访客在当前浏览器配置中使用模拟门店。可选 Gmail 连接你自己的 Google 账号，保存已批准的模拟草稿；可选 Runpod 使用你自己的端点和 Key，执行一次明确批准的付费复核。不共用站长密钥，本机安装版保持独立。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Setiap pelawat mempunyai kafe simulasi dalam profil pelayar ini. Gmail pilihan menyambungkan akaun Google anda untuk menyimpan draf demo yang diluluskan. Runpod pilihan menggunakan endpoint dan kunci anda untuk satu semakan berbayar yang diluluskan secara nyata. Tiada kunci pemilik dikongsi. Aplikasi setempat kekal berasingan.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Cada visitante tiene una cafetería simulada en este perfil del navegador. Gmail opcional conecta tu cuenta para guardar un borrador aprobado. Runpod opcional usa tu endpoint y clave para una revisión de pago autorizada expresamente. No se comparten claves del propietario. La aplicación local sigue siendo independiente.</span></span></p><a class="text-link" href="/privacy/"><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Read the privacy policy →</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">阅读隐私政策 →</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Baca dasar privasi →</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Lee la política de privacidad →</span></span></a></div></section>
+<section class="wrap index-note"><div><h3><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">A demonstration, with honest limits.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">演示有清楚的使用范围。</span></span></h3><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Sales and inventory examples are synthetic. Forecast accuracy for a real café has not been validated. Weather data and optional cloud inference require their respective services; owner approval remains essential.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">销量与库存是模拟资料，真实门店预测效果尚未验证。天气及本机应用的可选云端推理依赖对应服务，采购仍需人工核对。</span></span></p></div><div lang="zh-CN"><h3 class="locale-zh">明日备货，让收店前的决定更清楚。</h3><p class="locale-zh">进入访客演示，在浏览器里查看天气与假日影响，按包装修改采购量，确认后下载供应商草稿。每位访客使用独立模拟门店；不会连接真实邮箱、远程模型或本机老板工作台。</p></div></section></main><div class="notice"><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Optional advanced WhatsApp testing uses your own Meta account. Review the real recipient and approved template, then confirm sending separately. Purchase approval alone never sends a message. Meta setup and permissions are required; the public demo does not use the owner’s WhatsApp credentials.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">可选的 WhatsApp 高级测试使用你自己的 Meta 账号。核对真实收件人及已批准模板后，需要另行确认发送；采购审批本身不会发消息。此功能需要完成 Meta 配置和权限，公开演示不使用老板的 WhatsApp 凭据。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Ujian lanjutan WhatsApp pilihan menggunakan akaun Meta anda sendiri. Semak penerima sebenar dan templat diluluskan, kemudian sahkan penghantaran secara berasingan. Kelulusan pembelian sahaja tidak menghantar mesej. Persediaan dan kebenaran Meta diperlukan; demo awam tidak menggunakan kelayakan WhatsApp pemilik.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Las pruebas avanzadas opcionales de WhatsApp usan tu cuenta de Meta. Revisa el destinatario real y la plantilla aprobada, y confirma el envío por separado. Aprobar la compra no envía mensajes. Requiere configuración y permisos de Meta; la demo no usa las credenciales de WhatsApp del propietario.</span></span></p></div>
