+<main id="main" class="wrap document"><aside class="doc-side"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Project information</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">项目信息</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Clear information for informed authorization.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">授权前，清楚了解资料用途。</span></span></p><nav aria-label="Policy navigation" data-aria-en="Policy navigation" data-aria-zh="政策导航"><a href="/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Overview</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">项目介绍</span></span></a><a href="/privacy/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Privacy policy</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">隐私政策</span></span></a><a href="/terms/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Terms of use</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">使用条款</span></span></a></nav></aside><article class="doc-content"><h1><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Privacy policy</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">隐私政策</span></span></h1><p class="doc-intro"><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">How the public demo and separate local app handle your data.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">公开演示与独立本机应用如何处理资料。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Cara demo awam dan aplikasi setempat mengendalikan data.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Cómo tratan tus datos la demo pública y la aplicación local.</span></span></p>
+<p class="updated"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Effective date: 23 October 2026 · Application: Cafe Replenishment</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">生效日期：2026年10月22日 · 应用：Cafe Replenishment</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="operator"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">1. The project and this website</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">1. 项目和公开网站</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">The public site provides an independent browser café simulation without an application account. Simulated stock, approvals, drafts and audit history remain in localStorage in this browser profile; shared profiles share that state. Reset demo clears simulation data, not downloads, history or provider records. It does not connect to the separate local owner workbench.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">公开网站提供无需应用账户的独立浏览器门店模拟。模拟库存、审批、草稿和日志保存在当前浏览器配置的 localStorage，共用配置的使用者共享数据。重置清除模拟资料，不删除下载、浏览历史或服务商记录；不会连接独立本机老板工作台。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Laman awam menyediakan simulasi kafe tanpa akaun aplikasi. Stok, kelulusan, draf dan sejarah simulasi disimpan dalam localStorage profil pelayar; profil dikongsi berkongsi data. Tetapan semula tidak memadam muat turun, sejarah atau rekod penyedia. Ia tidak menyambung ke meja kerja pemilik setempat.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">El sitio ofrece una simulación sin cuenta de aplicación. Inventario, aprobaciones, borradores e historial simulados quedan en localStorage de este perfil; los perfiles compartidos comparten esos datos. Restablecer no borra descargas, historial ni registros de proveedores. No conecta con el panel local del propietario.</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">The hosting provider may process ordinary request information such as IP addresses, browser information, access logs or platform session data. The site does not add its own advertising trackers or analytics scripts.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">托管服务商可能处理 IP、浏览器、请求日志或平台会话资料。网站没有额外广告追踪器或分析脚本。</span></span></p>
+<p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Weather is requested directly from Open-Meteo for fixed Kuala Lumpur coordinates and the selected date. Your actual location is not used. Weather simulations are labelled. Hosting and external providers may process ordinary network request information. The app adds no advertising trackers. Keep private business information out of the simulation.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">天气以固定吉隆坡坐标和所选日期直接请求 Open-Meteo，不读取实际位置；模拟天气会标注。托管和第三方服务可能处理常规网络请求资料。应用不添加广告追踪器，请勿在模拟中填写机密业务资料。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Cuaca diminta terus daripada Open-Meteo bagi koordinat tetap Kuala Lumpur dan tarikh pilihan, tanpa lokasi sebenar anda. Simulasi dilabel. Pengehos dan penyedia boleh memproses maklumat rangkaian biasa. Tiada penjejak iklan ditambah. Jangan masukkan maklumat perniagaan sulit.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">El clima se consulta directamente en Open-Meteo con coordenadas fijas de Kuala Lumpur y la fecha elegida, sin usar tu ubicación real. Las simulaciones se identifican. Los proveedores pueden procesar información habitual de red. No añadimos rastreadores publicitarios. No introduzcas datos comerciales confidenciales.</span></span></p><h2 id="public-gmail"><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Public Gmail connection</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">公开版 Gmail 连接</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Sambungan Gmail awam</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Conexión pública de Gmail</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Gmail is optional. Google Identity Services asks for openid, email and gmail.compose. Google defines gmail.compose as managing drafts and sending email; this implementation only creates drafts and has no send operation. The account identity identifies the destination mailbox. No inbox or existing message bodies are imported. The Google app is currently unverified; Google may display a warning and restrict authorization to 100 users until approval.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">Gmail 为可选连接。Google Identity Services 请求 openid、email 和 gmail.compose，用账号身份确认目标邮箱。Google 的 gmail.compose 权限包含管理草稿和发送邮件；当前实现只有创建草稿，没有发送操作，不导入收件箱或已有邮件正文。应用尚未经 Google 验证，Google 可能显示提示，并在审核通过前将授权人数限制为 100 人。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Gmail ialah pilihan. Google Identity Services meminta openid, email dan gmail.compose untuk mengenal pasti peti mel. Skop gmail.compose boleh mengurus draf dan menghantar e-mel; pelaksanaan ini hanya mencipta draf tanpa operasi penghantaran. Peti masuk atau kandungan mesej sedia ada tidak diimport. Aplikasi belum disahkan Google; amaran dan had 100 pengguna mungkin dikenakan sebelum kelulusan.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Gmail es opcional. Google Identity Services solicita openid, email y gmail.compose para identificar el buzón. gmail.compose permite gestionar borradores y enviar correos; esta implementación solo crea borradores y no tiene una operación de envío. No importa la bandeja de entrada ni mensajes existentes. La aplicación no está verificada; Google puede mostrar avisos y limitar la autorización a 100 usuarios hasta aprobarla.</span></span></p><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">The browser sends your selected approved demo recipient, subject and body directly to Google only after a separate preview confirmation. Tokens, account identity, draft IDs and duplicate locks stay in tab memory, not this site’s backend or browser storage. No refresh token is requested; when access expires, reconnect using Google. Closing or reloading clears that session and its duplicate locks. An uncertain save blocks another attempt in that tab; check Gmail before reconnecting or reloading.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">单独预览确认后，浏览器才将所选已批准模拟收件人、标题和正文直接提交 Google。令牌、账号身份、草稿 ID 和防重复锁仅保留在标签页内存，不写入本站后端或浏览器存储。不请求刷新令牌；访问过期后通过 Google 重新连接。关闭或刷新会清除会话和防重复锁；保存结果不确定时本标签页会阻止再次提交，重新连接或刷新前请先检查 Gmail。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Selepas pengesahan pratonton berasingan, pelayar menghantar penerima demo, subjek dan isi yang diluluskan terus kepada Google. Token, identiti, ID draf dan kunci pendua hanya berada dalam memori tab, bukan backend atau storan pelayar. Tiada refresh token diminta; sambung semula apabila akses tamat. Tutup atau muat semula memadam sesi dan kunci. Jika hasil tidak pasti, semak Gmail sebelum menyambung atau memuat semula.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Tras confirmar una vista previa, el navegador envía directamente a Google destinatario simulado, asunto y cuerpo aprobados. Tokens, identidad, IDs y bloqueos de duplicados quedan solo en memoria de la pestaña, no en el servidor ni almacenamiento del navegador. No se solicita refresh token; reconecta cuando caduque el acceso. Cerrar o recargar borra sesión y bloqueos. Un resultado incierto bloquea otro intento en esa pestaña; revisa Gmail antes de reconectar o recargar.</span></span></p><h2 id="public-runpod"><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Visitor-owned Runpod review</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">访客自备 Runpod 复核</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Semakan Runpod milik pelawat</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Revisión con tu Runpod</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">You provide your endpoint, model and API key. The key passes over HTTPS through the same-site Netlify function to Runpod for the approved request; it is not saved by application code. Only synthetic SKU forecasts, target date, temperature, rainfall and holiday flag are sent. Gmail information, supplier contacts and email contents are never included or used for AI training. The preview shows the exact payload. Every paid submission requires an explicit click. Results advise; local quantities and human approval remain authoritative.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">你自行提供端点、模型和 API Key。批准调用时，Key 通过 HTTPS 经本站 Netlify 函数转给 Runpod，应用代码不保存 Key。只发送模拟商品预测、目标日期、气温、降雨和假日标记，不包含 Gmail 资料、供应商联系信息或邮件正文，也不将其用于 AI 训练。预览展示准确载荷，每次付费提交都需明确点击。结果仅供参考，采购计算和人工审批保持有效。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Anda menyediakan endpoint, model dan API key. Bagi permintaan diluluskan, kunci melalui HTTPS dan fungsi Netlify laman ini ke Runpod; kod aplikasi tidak menyimpannya. Hanya ramalan SKU simulasi, tarikh, suhu, hujan dan tanda cuti dihantar. Maklumat Gmail, pembekal dan isi e-mel tidak disertakan atau digunakan melatih AI. Pratonton menunjukkan payload tepat; setiap penghantaran berbayar memerlukan klik nyata. Hasil hanya nasihat; kiraan setempat dan kelulusan manusia kekal berkuasa.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Aportas endpoint, modelo y API key. En la solicitud aprobada, la clave pasa por HTTPS y la función Netlify del sitio a Runpod; el código no la guarda. Solo se envían previsiones simuladas por SKU, fecha, temperatura, lluvia y festivo. Nunca se incluyen datos Gmail, contactos de proveedores ni correos, ni se usan para entrenar IA. La vista previa muestra el contenido exacto y cada envío de pago exige un clic. El resultado es orientativo; cálculo local y aprobación humana siguen siendo la referencia.</span></span></p><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Limits include 1024 output tokens, 10 seconds of active inference, a five-minute job lifetime and durable site-wide operation caps. These do not guarantee a price or completion. No paid auto-retries or automatic polling occur. A manual status check retrieves the same job without resubmitting. Durable storage retains hashes, counters, nonces, states and bounded job IDs, never keys or raw forecasts. Ambiguous results keep the original submission locked, including after reload.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">限制包括最多 1024 输出 token、10 秒实际推理、5 分钟任务总寿命及全站持久化调用上限；这些不能保证费用或完成时间。没有付费自动重试或自动轮询；手动查状态只查询同一任务，不重新提交。持久存储只保留哈希、计数、随机标识、状态及受限任务 ID，不保存 Key 或原始预测。结果不确定时原提交保持锁定，刷新后仍有效。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Had termasuk 1024 token output, 10 saat inferens aktif, hayat tugas lima minit dan had operasi seluruh laman. Ini tidak menjamin harga atau kejayaan. Tiada cubaan semula berbayar atau polling automatik. Semakan manual membaca tugas sama tanpa penghantaran semula. Storan kekal hanya menyimpan hash, kiraan, nonce, status dan ID tugas terhad, bukan kunci atau ramalan mentah. Hasil tidak pasti kekal dikunci selepas muat semula.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Los límites incluyen 1024 tokens de salida, 10 segundos de inferencia activa, cinco minutos de vida del trabajo y topes persistentes del sitio. No garantizan precio ni finalización. No hay reintentos de pago ni sondeo automático. La consulta manual recupera el mismo trabajo sin reenviarlo. Se conservan hashes, contadores, nonces, estados e IDs acotados, nunca claves ni previsiones completas. Los envíos inciertos siguen bloqueados tras recargar.</span></span></p><h2 id="public-disconnect"><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Disconnecting your public session</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">断开公开版会话</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Memutuskan sesi awam</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Desconectar la sesión pública</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Disconnect forgets the tab’s Gmail connection. Revoke also asks Google to revoke access; failures are reported and you can use Google Account connections. Neither action deletes existing Gmail drafts. Clear Runpod credentials or close the tab to forget its key. These public-session rules differ from the local installed app’s DPAPI-protected refresh tokens described below.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">断开会清除标签页的 Gmail 连接；撤销还会请求 Google 撤销授权，失败会提示，也可在 Google 账户第三方连接中处理。两者都不删除 Gmail 已有草稿。清除 Runpod 凭据或关闭标签页可忘记 Key。公开版会话规则与下述本机安装版的 DPAPI 保护刷新令牌不同。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Putuskan melupakan sambungan Gmail tab. Batalkan juga meminta Google menarik akses; kegagalan dipaparkan dan boleh diurus melalui sambungan Akaun Google. Draf sedia ada tidak dipadam. Kosongkan kelayakan Runpod atau tutup tab untuk melupakan kunci. Peraturan ini berbeza daripada refresh token terlindung DPAPI aplikasi setempat di bawah.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Desconectar olvida la conexión Gmail de la pestaña. Revocar también solicita retirar el acceso a Google; se informan fallos y puedes usar las conexiones de tu cuenta. Ninguna acción borra borradores existentes. Borra las credenciales Runpod o cierra la pestaña para olvidar la clave. Estas reglas difieren de los refresh tokens protegidos por DPAPI de la aplicación local descrita abajo.</span></span></p><h2 id="local"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">2. Information in the separate local application</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">2. 独立本机应用的资料</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">The application currently uses synthetic sales and inventory for demonstrations. On the operator’s computer it stores recipes, ingredient stock, supplier contact details, demand forecasts, procurement lists, approval history, supplier draft contents and API export status. The operator controls this local runtime directory.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">另行安装的本机应用使用模拟销量和库存，并在操作者电脑保存配方、供应商资料、需求预测、采购清单、审批、草稿及导出状态；本机运行目录由操作者控制。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="gmail"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">3. Google information and Gmail permissions</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">3. Google 资料与 Gmail 权限</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Connecting Gmail is optional and begins from the local owner workbench. The application requests <code>https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.compose</code>. This Google permission includes managing drafts and sending email. The current application uses it to check connectivity and create procurement drafts; it has no email-sending operation.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">以下 Gmail 功能仅属于另行安装的本机应用。连接可选，并从本机老板工作台开始；gmail.compose 权限包含管理草稿和发送邮件，但当前程序只有连接检查和草稿创建，没有发送操作。</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">A connection check requests a list containing at most one draft’s identifiers. It does not fetch message bodies. Creating a draft submits the owner-approved supplier recipient, email subject and message body to Google. Gmail returns draft and message identifiers, which are stored locally with export status. The application does not import the inbox or read received email content.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">连接检查最多读取一份草稿的标识，不读取邮件正文。创建草稿时，已批准的供应商地址、主题及正文会发送给 Google，返回标识保存在本机用于避免重复；程序不读取收件箱。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="credentials"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">4. Authorization credentials and automatic refresh</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">4. 凭据与自动刷新</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">OAuth client credentials, access tokens and refresh tokens are stored by the local server. On Windows they are protected using current-user DPAPI. Other supported platforms use a file with restricted permissions; this is not described as encryption. Credentials are not returned to the phone workbench, embedded in this website, included in supplier messages, or intentionally recorded in application logs.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">Google 客户端密钥、访问及刷新令牌由本机服务保管。Windows 使用当前用户 DPAPI；其他支持平台使用受限权限文件。令牌不会回传手机、放进公开网站、供应商消息或有意记录在日志中。</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">When needed for a connection check or draft creation, the local server sends the refresh token to Google’s token service to obtain an access token. Authorization is not permanent: Google test-mode limits, revocation, password changes or account policies may require another browser authorization. The owner can configure service credentials through environment variables; those overrides are managed separately.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">本机服务在检查连接或创建草稿时按需向 Google 申请新访问令牌。测试模式限制、撤销、改密或账户政策仍可能要求重新授权；环境变量覆盖由操作者另行管理。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="sharing"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">5. Other services and AI processing</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">5. 其他服务与 AI 处理</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">If enabled, Runpod receives selected forecasting inputs: product identifiers, demand estimates, permitted adjustment limits and selected weather and holiday context. The current application does not send Google-derived Gmail information, Google OAuth credentials, supplier contacts or procurement email bodies to Runpod, and does not use Google user data to train AI models.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">本机应用启用 Runpod 后只提交选定预测输入、允许调整范围及天气假日情景，不提交 Gmail 数据、Google 凭据、供应商联系方式或邮件正文；Google 用户数据不用于训练 AI。</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Weather requests use the configured city or coordinates with the weather provider. A WhatsApp prefilled link includes the supplier phone number and draft text when the owner opens that link. Sending a WhatsApp message remains the owner’s action. Google, Runpod, the weather provider and WhatsApp process submitted information under their own policies.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">本机天气请求使用设定城市或坐标。WhatsApp 预填链接包含供应商号码和草稿文字，发送仍由操作者确认；第三方按各自政策处理资料。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="limited-use"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">6. Google API Limited Use</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">6. Google API 限制使用</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Cafe Replenishment’s use and transfer to any other app of information received from Google APIs will adhere to the <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including its Limited Use requirements. Google user data is used to provide the requested Gmail draft functionality. It is not sold, used for advertising, or used to train generalized AI models.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">Cafe Replenishment 使用和向其他应用传输 Google API 数据时遵守 Google API Services User Data Policy 及 Limited Use 要求。数据仅用于所请求的 Gmail 草稿功能，不出售、不用于广告或训练通用 AI。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="retention"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">7. Retention, disconnection and deletion</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">7. 保留、断开和删除</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Local procurement and approval records remain in the runtime directory until the operator deletes them. Successful draft identifiers and export statuses remain so the application can avoid duplicate creation. There is no scheduled automatic purge.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">本机采购与审批记录保留到操作者删除，成功草稿标识及导出状态用于避免重复，没有定时自动清除。</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">“Disconnect Gmail” attempts to revoke the Google authorization and clears locally saved access and refresh tokens. It retains desktop client settings, local procurement records and draft content. If Google revocation cannot be confirmed, the workbench reports that uncertainty. Credentials supplied by environment variables must also be removed from the launch environment.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">断开 Gmail 会尝试撤销 Google 授权并清除本机访问和刷新令牌；保留客户端配置、本机采购和草稿。无法确认撤销时会明确提示；环境变量凭据仍需自行移除。</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">You can revoke the application from <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/connections">Google Account third-party connections</a>. Revocation does not delete drafts already saved in Gmail. Delete those in Gmail, and remove local records from the runtime directory when no longer needed. Close the local server before deleting its runtime files.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">可在 Google 账户第三方连接撤销授权。撤销不会删除 Gmail 已有草稿；需要自行在 Gmail 删除。删除本机记录前请先关闭服务器。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="contact"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">8. Contact and policy changes</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">8. 联系与政策更新</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Contact the application owner using the developer support email shown on Google’s authorization screen.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">联系方式请参考 Google 授权页显示的开发者支持邮箱。</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Policy changes will be reflected on this page with an updated effective date. Material changes to how the application uses Google data require an updated disclosure and any authorization required by Google.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">政策变化会在本页更新生效日期。涉及 Google 数据用途的重大变化会更新披露并取得 Google 要求的授权。</span></span></p><div class="notice locale-zh" lang="zh-Hans">中文摘要：公开演示的模拟库存、审批与草稿保存在当前浏览器，可重置；同一浏览器配置的使用者共享该份本地状态。实时天气直接请求 Open-Meteo，公开演示不接入真实 Gmail 或 Runpod。另行安装的本机应用有独立的库存、采购记录及授权。Gmail 授权用于检查连接和创建已审批草稿；Google 权限本身包含发送能力，但当前程序没有发送操作。Google 数据与令牌不用于 AI 训练。你可以在工作台断开授权，并到 Google 账户撤销；已生成草稿需在 Gmail 中自行删除。</div><h2 id="whatsapp"><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Optional WhatsApp Cloud API tests</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">可选 WhatsApp Cloud API 测试</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Ujian pilihan WhatsApp Cloud API</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Pruebas opcionales de WhatsApp Cloud API</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">An advanced test option lets you use your own Meta business account and temporary access token. Credentials remain only in the current tab memory; reloading clears them. Each request passes the token, sender and recipient numbers, approved template and selected purchase summary through this site’s Netlify Function to Meta. They are not shared with other visitors or sent to the local owner workbench. The function does not persist the token, raw numbers or message body. Netlify Blobs stores hashed send keys, request and claim IDs, timestamps, acceptance status and Meta message IDs to prevent duplicate sends. Hosting request metadata may be logged separately. Unknown outcomes stay blocked and are not automatically retried; clearing browser state does not remove these server-side duplicate guards. Do not enter confidential business information. This is a bring-your-own-token testing option, not an approved Embedded Signup connection for arbitrary businesses. Removing a token here does not revoke it at Meta or delete delivered messages.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">高级测试入口使用你自己的 Meta 业务账号和临时访问令牌。凭据只保存在当前标签页内存，刷新即清除。每次请求会经本网站的 Netlify Function 向 Meta 传递令牌、发送和接收号码、已批准模板及选定的采购摘要；不与其他访客共享，也不传给本机老板工作台。函数不持久化令牌、原号码或正文。Netlify Blobs 只保存发送去重哈希、请求与认领编号、时间、受理状态和 Meta 消息编号，避免重复发送；托管请求元信息可能另有日志。结果未知时保持阻断，不自动重试；清除浏览器资料不会删除服务器去重记录。请勿填写机密业务资料。此为自行提供令牌的测试入口，不是已获审核的任意商户 Embedded Signup 接入。在此清除令牌不会撤销 Meta 授权或删除已送达消息。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Pilihan ujian lanjutan menggunakan akaun perniagaan Meta dan token sementara anda sendiri. Kelayakan hanya berada dalam memori tab semasa dan dibuang apabila dimuat semula. Setiap permintaan menghantar token, nombor penghantar dan penerima, templat diluluskan serta ringkasan pembelian melalui Netlify Function laman ini kepada Meta. Ia tidak dikongsi dengan pelawat lain atau ruang kerja pemilik tempatan. Fungsi tidak menyimpan token, nombor asal atau isi mesej. Netlify Blobs menyimpan kunci hash pencegah pendua, ID permintaan dan tuntutan, masa, status penerimaan serta ID mesej Meta. Metadata permintaan pengehosan mungkin dilog berasingan. Keputusan tidak diketahui kekal disekat tanpa cubaan semula automatik; memadam data pelayar tidak memadam perlindungan pelayan. Jangan masukkan maklumat sulit. Ini pilihan ujian token sendiri, bukan Embedded Signup yang diluluskan untuk semua perniagaan. Memadam token di sini tidak membatalkannya di Meta atau memadam mesej yang telah dihantar.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">La opción avanzada usa tu propia cuenta empresarial de Meta y un token temporal. Las credenciales solo permanecen en memoria de la pestaña; recargar las elimina. Cada solicitud transmite token, números de emisor y destinatario, plantilla aprobada y resumen de compra mediante la Netlify Function de este sitio a Meta. No se comparten con otros visitantes ni con el panel local del propietario. La función no conserva token, números originales ni cuerpo del mensaje. Netlify Blobs guarda claves hash contra duplicados, identificadores de solicitud y reserva, fechas, estado de aceptación e identificadores de mensaje de Meta. El alojamiento puede registrar metadatos por separado. Los resultados desconocidos permanecen bloqueados sin reintentos automáticos; borrar el navegador no elimina estas protecciones del servidor. No introduzcas información confidencial. Es una prueba con token propio, no Embedded Signup aprobado para cualquier empresa. Borrar el token aquí no lo revoca en Meta ni elimina mensajes entregados.</span></span></p><h2><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Personal sandbox</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">本人沙盒</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Sandbox peribadi</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Sandbox personal</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Optional personal sandbox exploration uses your own 360dialog sandbox key and its fixed recipient. The free sandbox permits up to 200 requests and is for testing only, not a production supplier service or a way to remove Meta restrictions. Keys and recipient identifiers stay only in tab memory. Preview and send submit them to this site’s function; only a separately confirmed send contacts 360dialog. Durable protection retains hashes, status and acceptance IDs, never raw keys, recipients or purchase text. Ownership, approval and recent contact are browser-local user declarations, not independently verified facts; the provider enforces its own recipient and conversation rules. You must personally contact the official sandbox within 24 hours. No automatic delivery receipts or inbound webhooks are configured; acceptance is not delivery. Unknown results remain blocked from automatic resending.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">可选的本人沙盒探索使用你自己的 360dialog 沙盒 Key 及其绑定的固定本人标识。免费沙盒最多 200 次请求，仅供测试；不是正式供应商服务，也不会解除 Meta 限制。Key 和本人标识仅留在标签内存；预览与发送时提交至本站函数，只有另行确认发送才请求 360dialog。持久保护仅保存哈希、状态与受理编号，不保存原始 Key、本人标识或采购正文。本人身份、审批和近期联系仅为浏览器中的用户声明，本站不独立验证；提供方执行自己的收件人与会话限制。你须在 24 小时内亲自联系官方沙盒。未配置自动送达回执或来信 webhook；受理不代表送达，未知结果禁止自动重发。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Penerokaan sandbox peribadi pilihan menggunakan kunci 360dialog anda dan penerima tetapnya. Sandbox percuma membenarkan sehingga 200 permintaan untuk ujian sahaja, bukan perkhidmatan pembekal produksi atau cara membuka sekatan Meta. Kunci dan pengenal penerima kekal dalam memori tab. Pratonton dan hantar menyerahkannya ke fungsi laman; hanya penghantaran disahkan menghubungi 360dialog. Perlindungan tahan lama menyimpan hash, status dan ID penerimaan, bukan kunci mentah, penerima atau teks pembelian. Pemilikan, kelulusan dan hubungan terkini ialah pengakuan pengguna setempat, bukan fakta disahkan bebas; penyedia menguatkuasakan peraturannya. Anda mesti menghubungi sandbox sendiri dalam 24 jam. Tiada resit penghantaran automatik atau webhook masuk; penerimaan bukan penghantaran. Keputusan tidak diketahui disekat daripada cuba semula automatik.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">La exploración opcional del sandbox personal utiliza tu clave de 360dialog y su destinatario fijo. El sandbox gratuito permite hasta 200 solicitudes solo para pruebas; no es un servicio de proveedores en producción ni elimina restricciones de Meta. La clave y el identificador quedan en memoria de la pestaña. La vista previa y el envío los pasan a la función del sitio; solo un envío confirmado contacta a 360dialog. La protección persistente conserva hashes, estados e IDs de aceptación, nunca claves, destinatarios o textos sin procesar. La propiedad, aprobación y contacto reciente son declaraciones locales, no hechos verificados independientemente; el proveedor aplica sus propias reglas. Debes contactar personalmente al sandbox en 24 horas. No hay recibos automáticos ni webhooks entrantes; aceptación no es entrega. Los resultados desconocidos bloquean reenvíos automáticos.</span></span></p></article></main>
