+<body class="public-single-language"><a class="skip" href="#main"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Skip to content</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">跳到内容</span></span></a><header><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/assets/mark.svg" width="42" height="42" alt=""><span>Cafe Replenishment<small><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">KUALA LUMPUR DEMO</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">明日备货 · 吉隆坡演示</span></span></small></span></a><nav aria-label="Website navigation" data-aria-en="Website navigation" data-aria-zh="网站导航"><a href="/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Overview</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">项目介绍</span></span></a><a href="/demo/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Try the demo</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">体验演示</span></span></a><a href="/privacy/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Privacy</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">隐私</span></span></a><a href="/terms/" aria-current="page"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Terms</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">条款</span></span></a><button type="button" class="language-settings" data-language-settings>Settings</button></nav></div></header>
+<main id="main" class="wrap document"><aside class="doc-side"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Project information</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">项目信息</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Clear information for informed authorization.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">授权前，清楚了解资料用途。</span></span></p><nav aria-label="Policy navigation" data-aria-en="Policy navigation" data-aria-zh="政策导航"><a href="/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Overview</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">项目介绍</span></span></a><a href="/privacy/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Privacy policy</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">隐私政策</span></span></a><a href="/terms/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Terms of use</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">使用条款</span></span></a></nav></aside><article class="doc-content"><h1><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Terms of use</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">使用条款</span></span></h1><p class="doc-intro"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">These terms describe the public browser demonstration, the separate local Cafe Replenishment application and their practical limits.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">本条款说明公开浏览器演示、另行安装的本机应用及它们的实际使用范围。</span></span></p><p class="updated"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Effective date: 23 October 2026 · Application: Cafe Replenishment</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">生效日期：2026年10月22日 · 应用：Cafe Replenishment</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="purpose"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">1. Intended use</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">1. 使用目的</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Cafe Replenishment is an independently maintained software demonstration for forecasting café demand, reviewing replenishment quantities and preparing supplier drafts. It currently uses synthetic demonstration sales and stock records. The public demo stores simulated state in this browser and generates downloadable drafts. It is not a validated production inventory, accounting or purchasing service. Do not use it as the only record for real business operations.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">本项目用于演示咖啡店需求预测、补货核对与供应商草稿。公开演示使用模拟销量和库存，资料保存在当前浏览器，不是经过验证的生产库存、会计或采购服务，不应作为真实经营的唯一记录。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="review"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">2. Owner review and purchasing</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">2. 人工核对与采购</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">The owner is responsible for verifying stock counts, recipes, units, pack sizes, supplier details, prices, delivery arrangements and expiry dates before purchasing. Forecasts, weather context and holiday effects are estimates. They do not guarantee future demand, ingredient availability, cost savings or business outcomes.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">操作者在采购前需核对实际库存、配方、单位、包装、供应商、价格、配送和效期。预测、天气及假日影响都是估算，不保证未来需求、供应、节约或经营效果。</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">In the public demo, approving a list creates browser-local simulated procurement records and downloadable supplier drafts. It does not create a shared shop order or contact a supplier. In the separate installed application, approving a list creates local procurement records and supplier drafts. Saving to Gmail creates a draft, not a supplier order or payment. Opening a WhatsApp prefilled link does not establish that a message was sent or a supplier accepted an order.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">公开演示批准后只生成本浏览器的模拟采购记录和可下载草稿，不联系供应商或建立共享订单。另行安装的本机应用有独立采购记录；保存 Gmail 草稿不是下单或付款，打开 WhatsApp 预填链接也不代表已经发送或被接受。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="accounts"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">3. Accounts, credentials and services</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">3. 账户、凭据和服务</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Use only accounts and service credentials you are authorized to use. The application’s Google connection is optional and requires your consent. You are responsible for access to the local computer and workbench and for protecting service credentials. Never publish access tokens, refresh tokens, client secrets or the private runtime directory.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">只使用有权使用的账户与凭据。本机应用的 Google 连接需要你同意；你需保护本机电脑、工作台及凭据，禁止公开令牌、客户端密钥或运行目录。</span></span></p><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Google, Runpod, weather and messaging services may have their own terms, quotas, availability limits and fees. Optional Runpod inference may incur charges. This website does not purchase domains, compute capacity, ingredients or supplier services on your behalf.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">第三方服务可能有独立条款、配额、可用性及费用；本机可选 Runpod 推理可能收费。网站不会代你购买域名、算力、食材或供应商服务。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="availability"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">4. Availability and limitations</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">4. 可用性与限制</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">The demonstration is provided as available, without a promise of uninterrupted service, forecast accuracy or suitability for a particular shop. Review outputs before relying on them. Local scheduled checks require the application’s server to remain running. A website deployment or Gmail connection does not itself validate the forecasting model.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">演示按现状提供，不承诺持续可用、预测准确或适合某家门店。使用前请核对；本机定时功能需要服务器在线。网站上线或连接 Gmail 不代表预测模型已通过真实验证。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="privacy"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">5. Privacy and access control</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">5. 隐私与访问控制</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Read the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> before connecting Google or another service. The public demo is separate from the local owner workbench and does not access its inventory, approval records or OAuth credentials. Demo state is specific to a browser profile; reset it before another person uses the same profile if you do not want them to see your demonstration. Disconnecting an integration does not erase existing procurement records or Gmail drafts.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">连接服务前请阅读隐私政策。公开演示与本机老板工作台分开，不读取其库存、审批或 Google 凭据。模拟资料属于当前浏览器配置；共享浏览器时可先重置。断开集成不会删除已有采购记录或 Gmail 草稿。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="responsible-use"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">6. Responsible use and changes</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">6. 负责任使用与变更</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Do not use the application to access another person’s account without permission, evade service restrictions or send unwanted messages. The project may change or discontinue features. These terms do not override rights or obligations that cannot be excluded under applicable law.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">不得未经同意访问他人账户、规避服务限制或发送不受欢迎的信息。功能可能变更或停止；条款不排除法律不得排除的权利和义务。</span></span></p>
+<h2 id="contact"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">7. Contact</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">7. 联系</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Contact the application owner using the developer support email shown on Google’s authorization screen.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">联系方式请参考 Google 授权页显示的开发者支持邮箱。</span></span></p><div class="notice locale-zh" lang="zh-Hans">中文摘要：这是使用模拟数据的补货演示。老板需核对实际库存、供应商和采购条件；预测不保证真实经营效果。审批和生成草稿均不代表已下单、已发送或已付款。第三方服务可能产生费用。</div><h2><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Optional WhatsApp Cloud API tests</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">可选 WhatsApp Cloud API 测试</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Ujian pilihan WhatsApp Cloud API</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Pruebas opcionales de WhatsApp Cloud API</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">WhatsApp API testing may send a real message after a separate confirmation. Use only your own authorized account and recipients who agreed to the message. Meta may apply message charges. An accepted API request is not delivery confirmation, a supplier order or payment. A hello_world test contains no procurement details. A purchase message requires the supported approved three-parameter template; free-form replies are not enabled without verified inbound-window records. Unknown results must be checked at Meta before any further action.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">WhatsApp API 测试在单独确认后可能发送真实消息。只使用你有权使用的账号，并确认收件人同意；Meta 可能收取消息费用。API 已受理不等于送达、供应商接单或付款。hello_world 测试不含采购内容。采购消息需要本系统支持的已批准三参数模板；没有经过验证的来信窗口记录时，不启用自由文本回复。结果未知时请先在 Meta 核对。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Ujian API WhatsApp boleh menghantar mesej sebenar selepas pengesahan berasingan. Gunakan akaun yang anda dibenarkan dan penerima yang bersetuju. Caj mesej Meta mungkin dikenakan. Penerimaan API bukan pengesahan penghantaran, pesanan pembekal atau pembayaran. Ujian hello_world tiada butiran pembelian. Mesej pembelian memerlukan templat tiga parameter diluluskan yang disokong; balasan bebas tidak diaktifkan tanpa rekod tetingkap masuk yang disahkan. Semak keputusan tidak diketahui di Meta sebelum tindakan seterusnya.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Las pruebas de WhatsApp pueden enviar mensajes reales tras una confirmación independiente. Usa cuentas autorizadas y destinatarios que hayan consentido. Meta puede aplicar cargos. Una solicitud aceptada no confirma entrega, pedido ni pago. hello_world no incluye datos de compra. El mensaje de compra requiere una plantilla aprobada compatible de tres parámetros; no se permiten respuestas libres sin registros verificados de la ventana de entrada. Comprueba los resultados desconocidos en Meta antes de actuar.</span></span></p><h2><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Personal sandbox</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">本人沙盒</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Sandbox peribadi</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Sandbox personal</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Optional personal sandbox exploration uses your own 360dialog sandbox key and its fixed recipient. The free sandbox permits up to 200 requests and is for testing only, not a production supplier service or a way to remove Meta restrictions. Keys and recipient identifiers stay only in tab memory. Preview and send submit them to this site’s function; only a separately confirmed send contacts 360dialog. Durable protection retains hashes, status and acceptance IDs, never raw keys, recipients or purchase text. Ownership, approval and recent contact are browser-local user declarations, not independently verified facts; the provider enforces its own recipient and conversation rules. You must personally contact the official sandbox within 24 hours. No automatic delivery receipts or inbound webhooks are configured; acceptance is not delivery. Unknown results remain blocked from automatic resending.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">可选的本人沙盒探索使用你自己的 360dialog 沙盒 Key 及其绑定的固定本人标识。免费沙盒最多 200 次请求，仅供测试；不是正式供应商服务，也不会解除 Meta 限制。Key 和本人标识仅留在标签内存；预览与发送时提交至本站函数，只有另行确认发送才请求 360dialog。持久保护仅保存哈希、状态与受理编号，不保存原始 Key、本人标识或采购正文。本人身份、审批和近期联系仅为浏览器中的用户声明，本站不独立验证；提供方执行自己的收件人与会话限制。你须在 24 小时内亲自联系官方沙盒。未配置自动送达回执或来信 webhook；受理不代表送达，未知结果禁止自动重发。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Penerokaan sandbox peribadi pilihan menggunakan kunci 360dialog anda dan penerima tetapnya. Sandbox percuma membenarkan sehingga 200 permintaan untuk ujian sahaja, bukan perkhidmatan pembekal produksi atau cara membuka sekatan Meta. Kunci dan pengenal penerima kekal dalam memori tab. Pratonton dan hantar menyerahkannya ke fungsi laman; hanya penghantaran disahkan menghubungi 360dialog. Perlindungan tahan lama menyimpan hash, status dan ID penerimaan, bukan kunci mentah, penerima atau teks pembelian. Pemilikan, kelulusan dan hubungan terkini ialah pengakuan pengguna setempat, bukan fakta disahkan bebas; penyedia menguatkuasakan peraturannya. Anda mesti menghubungi sandbox sendiri dalam 24 jam. Tiada resit penghantaran automatik atau webhook masuk; penerimaan bukan penghantaran. Keputusan tidak diketahui disekat daripada cuba semula automatik.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">La exploración opcional del sandbox personal utiliza tu clave de 360dialog y su destinatario fijo. El sandbox gratuito permite hasta 200 solicitudes solo para pruebas; no es un servicio de proveedores en producción ni elimina restricciones de Meta. La clave y el identificador quedan en memoria de la pestaña. La vista previa y el envío los pasan a la función del sitio; solo un envío confirmado contacta a 360dialog. La protección persistente conserva hashes, estados e IDs de aceptación, nunca claves, destinatarios o textos sin procesar. La propiedad, aprobación y contacto reciente son declaraciones locales, no hechos verificados independientemente; el proveedor aplica sus propias reglas. Debes contactar personalmente al sandbox en 24 horas. No hay recibos automáticos ni webhooks entrantes; aceptación no es entrega. Los resultados desconocidos bloquean reenvíos automáticos.</span></span></p><h2 id="public-cloud"><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Optional public cloud integrations</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">可选公开云端连接</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Integrasi awan awam pilihan</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Integraciones públicas opcionales</span></span></h2><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Each visitor has a simulated café in this browser profile. Optional Gmail connects your own Google account to save an approved demo draft. Optional Runpod uses your own endpoint and key for one explicitly approved paid review. No owner keys are shared. The local installed workbench remains separate.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">每位访客在当前浏览器配置中使用模拟门店。可选 Gmail 连接你自己的 Google 账号，保存已批准的模拟草稿；可选 Runpod 使用你自己的端点和 Key，执行一次明确批准的付费复核。不共用站长密钥，本机安装版保持独立。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Setiap pelawat mempunyai kafe simulasi dalam profil pelayar ini. Gmail pilihan menyambungkan akaun Google anda untuk menyimpan draf demo yang diluluskan. Runpod pilihan menggunakan endpoint dan kunci anda untuk satu semakan berbayar yang diluluskan secara nyata. Tiada kunci pemilik dikongsi. Aplikasi setempat kekal berasingan.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Cada visitante tiene una cafetería simulada en este perfil del navegador. Gmail opcional conecta tu cuenta para guardar un borrador aprobado. Runpod opcional usa tu endpoint y clave para una revisión de pago autorizada expresamente. No se comparten claves del propietario. La aplicación local sigue siendo independiente.</span></span></p><p><span class="bi" data-language-fixed="true"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Saving a Gmail draft is not sending email or placing an order. Runpod may charge your account even if a job queues or fails; inspect its own usage and budget. Preview before approving. The site does not provide an uptime, model accuracy, delivery or price guarantee. Google authorization remains subject to its unverified-app limits.</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">保存 Gmail 草稿不等于发送邮件或下单。Runpod 即使排队或失败也可能计费，请检查该平台用量和预算，批准前先预览。网站不保证可用性、模型准确性、送达或价格；Google 授权仍受未验证应用限制。</span><span class="bi-ms" lang="ms">Menyimpan draf Gmail bukan penghantaran e-mel atau pesanan. Runpod mungkin mengenakan caj walaupun tugas beratur atau gagal; semak penggunaan dan bajetnya. Pratonton sebelum meluluskan. Tiada jaminan masa operasi, ketepatan, penghantaran atau harga. Kebenaran Google tertakluk pada had aplikasi belum disahkan.</span><span class="bi-es" lang="es">Guardar un borrador no envía correo ni hace un pedido. Runpod puede cobrar incluso por trabajos en cola o fallidos; revisa su consumo y presupuesto. Previsualiza antes de aprobar. No se garantiza disponibilidad, precisión, entrega ni precio. La autorización Google sigue sujeta a límites de aplicaciones sin verificar.</span></span></p></article></main>
+<footer><div class="wrap footer-inner"><span><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Cafe Replenishment · Independently developed demonstration project</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">Cafe Replenishment · 独立开发的演示项目</span></span></span><div class="footer-links"><a href="/demo/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Try the demo</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">体验演示</span></span></a><a href="/privacy/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Privacy policy</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">隐私政策</span></span></a><a href="/terms/"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Terms of use</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">使用条款</span></span></a><a href="/privacy/#contact"><span class="bi"><span class="bi-en" lang="en">Contact</span><span class="bi-zh" lang="zh-Hans">联系</span></span></a></div></div></footer></body></html>
