+/**
+ * Advanced BYO WhatsApp Cloud API relay, not Meta Embedded Signup.
+ * The visitor supplies their own token per request; it is never persisted/logged.
+ * Procurement sends require an APPROVED three-parameter BODY template and an
+ * exact preview. No free-form sending or unverified 24-hour window is offered.
+ *
+ * Netlify Blobs atomically claims each sender/recipient/template/payload before
+ * POST. A missing/uncertain durable claim fails closed. No automatic POST retry,
+ * lease expiry, deletion or in-memory deduplication can resend an unknown result.
